  "id": "papez-circuit",
  "term": "Papez circuit",
  "definition": "Papez circuit is a brain network described here as linking the hippocampus and thalamus, with measurable coupled activity between its nodes. In this source, it is discussed as part of a larger Papez network in which stimulation and local field potential changes can be recorded.",
